# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation pour la dernière version de la diagonalisation quantique basée sur échantillons (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Instructions d'installation {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install, first create a new Python environment:\n"
msgstr "Pour installer, commence par créer un nouvel environnement Python :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prérequis {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Crée un environnement minimal avec uniquement Python installé. Nous recommandons d'utiliser des [environnements virtuels Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Active ton nouvel environnement.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Windows, run `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate` instead.\n"
msgstr "Sous Windows, exécute plutôt `\\path\\to\\virtual\\environment\\Scripts\\activate`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package – from PyPI or source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Il existe deux façons principales d'installer ce paquet : depuis PyPI ou depuis les sources. La méthode préférée est d'installer depuis PyPI :\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Installer depuis PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optional `sbd` and `fulqrum` extras, and the `notebook-dependencies` extra that includes them, are supported only on Linux and macOS.\n"
msgstr "Les extras optionnels `sbd` et `fulqrum`, ainsi que l'extra `notebook-dependencies` qui les inclut, ne sont pris en charge que sous Linux et macOS.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Installer depuis les sources {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source if you wish to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally.\n"
msgstr "Installe depuis les sources si tu souhaites développer dans le dépôt ou exécuter les notebooks en local.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first step is to clone the `qiskit-addon-sqd` repository.\n"
msgstr "La première étape consiste à cloner le dépôt `qiskit-addon-sqd`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Ensuite, mets à jour pip et place-toi dans le dépôt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-addon-sqd` to the virtual environment. If you plan on running the notebooks, install the notebook dependencies in order to run all the visualizations in the notebooks. Install the `dev` dependencies if you plan on developing in the repository.\n"
msgstr "L'étape suivante consiste à installer `qiskit-addon-sqd` dans l'environnement virtuel. Si tu prévois d'exécuter les notebooks, installe les dépendances des notebooks afin de pouvoir exécuter toutes les visualisations des notebooks. Installe les dépendances `dev` si tu prévois de développer dans le dépôt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Ajuste les options ci-dessous selon tes besoins.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the docs.\n"
msgstr "Si tu as installé les dépendances des notebooks, tu peux commencer en exécutant les notebooks de la documentation.\n"
